  "content": "\n\n<p>我将Fargo的魔石饰品制作成了具有我的世界特色的魂石饰品！这些饰品并没有Fargo原版那么强力，所以可以理解为是一个使用了Fargo材质和相似名字的模组。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5769d77a-a928-4687-8580-5b4eb04c72a6.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_46878e63-0d10-4acb-9e99-9be6e7a23187.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1b9e6435-651a-43dc-9a83-c937ba37d942.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bbc7fab0-1862-4fa3-afae-07cc27f3be7e.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3173d1b5-1849-4950-81f1-4c2bd6322894.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2be692db-f295-42ba-a607-8ffb7a71c1b0.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>",
